Tom, the n8n flow polls the ETA mailbox every 10 minutes, extracts the shipme=
nt number and the new ETA, and calls the RouteWise API to update the shipment=
. For mails without a fixed layout an extraction step with the language model=
 on our tenant reads the text. Anything below 0.8 confidence goes to a review=
 list in Teams instead of being written.

